{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44032","headline":"昭君怨 · 梁琼","name":"昭君怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自古无和亲，贻灾到妾身。\n朔风嘶去马，汉月出行轮。\n衣薄狼山雪，妆成虏塞春。\n回看父母国，生死毕胡尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"梁琼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44032.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44032","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}